WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.810
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki. 12 years old! {consistency}

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:06.190
Last time, there was a substitute manager for Ooshige-san.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.120
Unfortunately, it was no picnic in the park. {timing issue}

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:12.850
Mitsuki had to run all over 
the place... what a disaster!

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:16.740
In the end, he said he was going to quit being 
a manager and go back to the countryside...

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.480
We had to chase him around, too.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.640
Hey, Meroko!

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.470
Which pair of sandals should I take tomorrow?

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:13.730
Hmm... I'd have to go with the pink ones.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.420
You think so?

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.080
But...

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.300
...those ribbons are so cute!

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:19.360
Aren't they?

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:22.220
Then... why don't you just take both of them!

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:23.190
Great idea!

00:02:23.190 --> 00:02:25.240
That way I won't regret it later!

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.160
Yep!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.380
You're going to be working.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.870
Does it really matter?

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:29.850
What?!

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.940
It's the first time I get to stay overnight for a job!

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.680
It's not a small matter!

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.640
You totally don't get it!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Okay, okay.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.340
I guess someone like me wouldn't understand.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.510
That's right!

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.510
You couldn't possibly understand, Takuto!

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:47.800
Girls are always dreaming 
about meeting their prince.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:48.670
What? {end timing fixed}

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:50.010
Prince?

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:53.230
Yep... in order to meet that unknown prince someday...

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.910
...girls must always be totally prepared!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.160
Right, Mitsuki-chan?

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:58.610
Huh?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:02:59.480
<i>-chan</i> ?

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:00.090
Ah.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.210
That's right.

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.310
If you'll be gone overnight...

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.230
...I don't have to stay home, right?

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:09.480
Yep! I told Grandma that I'm going to a summer house with some friends from school. {merged}

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:11.970
Ah. What a relief!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:15.910
I was thinking that you'd leave me behind again.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:15.910
Is that so? {Overlap}

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.910
I’d have cried!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.100
I'm going then!

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:29.880
Have a safe trip.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:30.440
Okay!

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.070
Mitsuki-san.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:32.640
Hmm?

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.600
Take this with you.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:39.300
Give the letter to your friends' parents...

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.710
And give the sweets to your friends.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:43.940
Yes.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.400
Hey, isn't it her turn yet?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.340
I'm pretty sure it's almost time...

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:28.360
Oh no!

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.180
Hey, Meroko! {Overlap}

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.130
I'm going to drown!

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:34.500
Even if we drown, at least it's in the throes of love!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.140
Cut it out! {Overlap}

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:37.110
Thank you very much...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.650
...everyone in The

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.650
Scanty! {I may add a winding font for the stylized star in The Scanty}

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:41.530
Well, up next... we have, for everyone... {lead in fixed}

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.880
<i>Full Moon</i>-san.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.380
With her "Myself".

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:45.150
Go ahead!

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:46.190
What should I do?

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:49.040
Just relax a little longer.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:51.040
How many more are there?

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:51.860
Three.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.850
What? It's almost over?

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.430
That's why... we should just go for it.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:04:59.020
Sure... that's...

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.060
Quiet.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:07.240
What is it, Murakami?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:07.720
Shh!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:23.960
Hey!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.960
Cut it out!

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:26.380
Meroko!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.110
Her song!

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:27.790
What?

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:28.800
Listen to it!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.600
I'm listening!

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.520
You liar!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.490
Great job.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.800
Thanks for your help.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:44.520
Let's work again sometime.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.830
Ah, that’s right... can you 
go back to the hotel?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.500
You know where it is, right?

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:51.040
Yep!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:52.440
It's that, right?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:52.870
Eh?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.000
Huh?

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:56.890
Eh?

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:58.160
Ah, not that!

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.240
Over there, right?

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:00.370
Ah...

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.520
You're such a scatterbrain...

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.480
...so make sure to use a taxi.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:05.200
Okay!

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.360
Well then, I'll catch up with you soon. {edited}

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:09.160
Okay!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.320
It's not that far...

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:16.260
I should try walking once in while, right?

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:17.690
That's right.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.010
She was exaggerating... you can see the hotel from here.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.410
If you do that...

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:23.520
...you'll get lost.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:24.820
Nope, nope.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.060
If you keep a girl sheltered...

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:28.680
...she won't be able to fall in love.

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:29.320
Love?!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.250
That's right.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.050
What have you been thinking about?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.040
This is summer!

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:35.280
Summer is the season for love!

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.450
Right, Mitsuki?

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:36.940
Ah...

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:37.520
Huh?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:38.920
Mitsuki?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:39.950
Where'd you go?

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.770
The wind feels good...

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.980
Why... there's a cute girl here!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.660
Nice... really nice!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.210
What do you say about this girl then?

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.940
It'll work, right? Right?

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.200
Where are you going?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:15.910
Eh?

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.880
All alone...

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.280
You're bored, huh?

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.000
Hey?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.490
Why don't you have some fun with us?

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:22.740
No.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:23.770
What? What?

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.150
What'd you just say?

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.550
I can't hear you.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.210
Stop it...

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.420
Don't worry.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:29.970
Eh?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.270
It'll be just fine.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.520
Come on, let's go.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:34.300
No!

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.260
Mitsuki!

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:39.240
Come on... let's do something fun.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.480
What? Um...

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.180
This is your first time here, right?

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.480
We know all the fun places.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.010
Hey... won't you come with us?

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.400
What are you doing?!

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.440
Ow... ow... ow...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.850
What kind of foolishness is this?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:52.660
Do you guys...

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.320
...need another lesson?

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.800
Why are you here?!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:58.600
Damn it!

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.560
You better remember this!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.680
Are you all right?

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:06.200
Eh?

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:09.200
A-Ah... I-I'm fine.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:11.140
Thank you very much.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.520
It isn't safe for a girl to walk around alone.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:14.510
I'll escort you.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:15.270
Eh?!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.630
I-It's okay!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.090
Really?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:18.730
Eh?

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:29.040
Then... please do.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.480
What? What?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.430
He looks so refined!

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:35.740
This might be the beginning of a good thing for her!

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.160
Well... this is as far as I'll go.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:48.920
U-Um... thank you for escorting me...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.160
I feel like I should give you something in return...

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:52.030
I don't want anything.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.910
I just did what I should have done.

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:54.920
But...

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.750
Then, will you have a cup of tea with me?

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.340
Eh?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.340
Well... that's...

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:01.760
Is that okay?

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:04.480
Yes.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:06.620
That's great.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.310
Shall we go then?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.080
Ah!

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.270
This is good! This is good!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.240
Right, Takuto?

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.000
What is?

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.680
It's starting to blossom!

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.240
Midsummer's love!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.770
Ah... how wonderful!

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:17.330
Ah...

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.370
What?!

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.540
You heard me sing today?

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.310
Yes...

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:35.840
It was such a beautiful song... I was amazed.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.040
My heart is still racing.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.510
I'm kinda embarrassed...

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:43.040
Come on!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.990
Let's leave the young lovebirds alone!

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:45.560
Come on! Come on!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.890
Okay? Let's go! Let's go!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:47.940
Heh...

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:50.810
So this Eichi-kun is a very important person to you.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:51.770
Yep.

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:55.120
I'm singing so I can see Eichi-kun again.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.070
That's so romantic....

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:01.060
If I could be with a girl whose heart was as pure as yours, <i>Full Moon</i>-chan...

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.020
Just that... would make me happy.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:04.530
Eh?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:06.690
I...

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.790
...to help you to find Eichi-kun...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.990
...want to cheer you on.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:15.000
Thank you so much.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.660
You're late!

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:24.130
Hmm?

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.600
Takuto?

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.170
Who is that guy?

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.200
He was all over you.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:29.920
Takuto?

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.080
What are you talking about?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.470
Yeah!

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.480
Don't ever see that guy again.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:35.200
Huh? {there was Eh? before this line, but it's so sudden, it won't time properly, so I ommited it}

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.510
Why are you deciding that for me?

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:38.940
It doesn't matter!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.650
Murakami-san is my friend.

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:43.900
Are you saying I can't make friends?

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:45.550
So instead of listening to me...

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.410
...you're just going to trust some guy that you know nothing about? {edited so that "that" isn't used twice, lol}

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.550
Why are you saying that?!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:54.140
Murakami-kun said he'd help me find Eichi-kun! {Oh Mitsuki, you are definitely 12, so naive}

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.750
He's a really good person!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.920
Eichi again.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:57.240
Eh?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.420
That's all you ever talk about.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:00.260
See!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:03.590
Whenever I mention Eichi-kun,
 you get mad, Takuto!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.720
Murakami-san doesn't do that!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:06.760
I see.

00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:08.390
It seems like I’m easily angered!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.260
I'm totally different from that Murakami guy!

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.440
What's that?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.360
What are you so mad about?!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.350
Then, if you don't need me for anything...

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:17.310
Takuto!

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:18.280
Hey, Takuto!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.060
Where are you going?!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.370
Takuto! Takuto! {font scaling's so old-school, I am alpha timing this}

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:21.590
Takuto! Takuto! {font scaling's so old-school, I am alpha timing this}

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.320
Geez!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.280
What's he so mad about?

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.040
Mitsuki!

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.720
You're off today, so feel free to go have fun!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:44.590
Okay!

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:47.610
Hey, hey.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.320
You're finally getting a break, so don't waste it!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.120
I'm cheering for you!

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.910
Cheering... for what?

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.630
It's not important... not important.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.070
Wow!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.070
Such great weather...!

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:11.950
Come on!

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:13.960
Let's go look for the guy from yesterday!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.400
Eh?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.550
Guy from yesterday... who?

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.290
Man... did you already forget?

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.200
Murakami-kun! Murakami-kun! {alpha time}

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:19.910
Murakami-kun! Murakami-kun! {alpha time}

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:20.400
Eh?

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:21.760
Yo.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:22.750
We bumped into each other again.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.670
Ah... Murakami-san...

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.360
Are you on break today?

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.720
If that's the case... I'll show you around.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.760
If you'd like, we can ride on my yacht.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.470
Eh?

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:32.870
A yacht?

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:33.320
Ah...

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:34.790
Hmph.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.120
I understand.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.710
I place myself in your hands.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:42.350
Really?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.400
That's great!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.790
Let's head out at once!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:45.420
Yes.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:48.750
Hmph.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:49.950
Ah...

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:51.600
Hmph.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.870
Wow!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:05.450
Over there you can see Kujiraiwa.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.370
The one you can barely see 
beyond that is Gekkojima. {jima not jiwa}

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.800
There's not a cloud in the sky today, so you can see them clearly.

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:16.220
It must be because you're here.

00:13:16.220 --> 00:13:16.820
Eh?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:47.750
Takuto!

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.770
We've already reached the ocean!

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.980
We're finally alone!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.440
Let's enjoy our summer vacation!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.210
Come on... let's have fun!

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:58.500
What are you talking about?

00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.400
We have a job to do.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.400
Man... you're no fun.

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:05.900
Eh?

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:07.320
No way!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:08.890
Takuto.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.430
Those kids just said that they were going on a yacht, right?

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.700
I forgot.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.960
What are you saying?!

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.940
The word <i>yacht</i>  appeared in the handbook!

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:16.660
What?!

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:18.910
What?

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.220
Like I said... hold on.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.870
I'm almost there.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.830
You're telling the truth, right?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:26.830
If you don't kiss her by noon today...

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.900
...we get your yacht, right?

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.900
It's sure to go well.

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:33.620
There's no girl who can resist me.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.600
Don’t forget to videotape it.

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:37.540
I know.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.070
Bye.

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:42.120
That Murakami sure can do it.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:44.400
Year after year, he picks up an idol.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.100
He always makes them cry in the end.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:48.480
He deceives all of them with his looks. {edited}

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:51.690
At first glance... he's a good little prince.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.090
Wow!

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:59.120
There are so many fishes!

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:04.850
How is it?

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:05.690
Are you having fun?

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:06.210
Yep!

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:07.840
Hmm?

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:13.680
I'm very happy that I get to 
spend time alone with you.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.000
Is that so?

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.410
This is the first time I've been on a yacht, so...

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:18.630
I'm really happy!

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:19.830
I'm glad to hear that.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.010
By the way...

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.710
When are you going back, <i>Full Moon</i>-chan?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:25.600
Right after I'm done with work tomorrow.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:26.720
What...

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:29.060
Then... I won't be able to see you anymore...

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:31.430
It'll become so lonely...

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.030
That's right...

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.480
I found a seashell!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.650
Wow!

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:42.620
It's so pretty!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:43.840
Amazing!

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:45.450
It shines like a rainbow!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.310
Huh?

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.030
Did something happen to you, Murakami-san?

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.240
Oh, no... it's okay.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:53.340
I'm totally fine.

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.280
Where are you, Mitsuki?!

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.810
She cannot hear you calling out.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.680
What should we do then?!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.310
Anyways... just look for her!

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:06.600
I'm going to look over there...

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.560
...so you go that way!

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:08.530
Got it!

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:17.690
Wow!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.790
I don't want to let you go.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:20.550
Eh?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:22.930
Murakami-san?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.690
<i>Full Moon</i>-chan...

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.320
Um... you're making me feel uneasy. {edited}

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.650
Then... kiss me...

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:28.290
Eh?!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.970
If you don't give me a kiss...

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:30.960
...I won't let you go back.

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.010
N-No way!

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.980
I'm sorry.

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:35.490
Please take me back!

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:37.040
<i>Full Moon</i>-chan!

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:37.670
Yes?!

00:16:41.150 --> 00:16:42.200
<i>Full Moon</i>-chan...

00:16:57.580 --> 00:16:58.400
<i>Full Moon</i>...

00:16:58.880 --> 00:16:59.970
Your shyness...

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.080
...is cute.

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.800
Don’t be scared.

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.240
You'll be fine.

00:17:08.530 --> 00:17:09.660
<i>Full Moon</i>-chan...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.450
Man.

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:19.970
Don't make me worry about you.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.280
Takuto!

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:23.860
What were you doing?

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.300
That's why I said...

00:17:25.300 --> 00:17:27.240
...don't trust a guy like this!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.310
I'm sorry.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:42.080
Come on.

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:45.990
Take my hand.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:46.820
Let's go back.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:50.290
Okay!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.530
Come on.

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:53.750
Hold on tight.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.320
Okay!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.110
Are you okay?!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:40.960
Oh?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.100
What... Takuto got here first?

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.680
Just cut it out and help!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.000
Ah... okay.

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:50.800
Hey, hey...

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.430
Is that supposed to get us out of here?

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.770
I couldn't think of anything else!

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.230
Ah. It's here, it's here!

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.360
He's sound asleep.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:09.430
Just leave him alone.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:10.880
Is that okay?

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.480
What if he catches a cold...

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.760
It'll be fine.

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:15.150
Murakami!

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.280
Wake up, Murakami!

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.210
Who's that?

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:21.460
Beats me...

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:22.810
Uh...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.040
Where am I? Who am I? {alpha time}

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.000
Where am I? Who am I? {alpha time}

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.110
What are you saying, you lying jerk?!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:28.430
Eh?!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:29.380
Natsumi!

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.530
You've been keeping a lot from me!

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.550
You've gone on dates behind my back!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.200
Ah... ah... that's... {alpha time}

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:35.760
Ah... ah... that's... {alpha time}

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.390
Ah... ah... that's... {alpha time}

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:37.900
Hey, you over there...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:40.430
Don't believe a thing this guy says!

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:41.140
Eh?

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.270
What do you mean..? {edited}

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:43.370
This guy you know...

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.450
He boasts that he can get any 
popular idol he lays his eyes on!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:47.900
Eh?

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:52.670
To do that... he uses money and pretends to be all cool!

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.320
Right?!

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:54.580
Yes!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:02.010
Ah! That was a setup!

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:07.100
You probably bet your buddies that you could get a kiss or something off her before the day was over!

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.320
Really?

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.260
Murakami-san?

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:12.000
What a bastard!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:12.970
Mortal enemy of all women!

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:20.340
Mitsuki... {w00t}

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.080
You are the worst! {You go, girl!}

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:23.740
U-Um...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:25.270
Eh?!

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:27.630
I'm not going to forgive you for an act like that!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:33.740
Sa-Save me!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.410
I... can't swim!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:37.250
So uncool...

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.000
Hehe!

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.560
Serves you right!

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.380
Women are scary.

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:52.470
I was so sure that he was a good person.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:56.330
You trust people too easily.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:56.920
Dummy.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:58.410
Dummy?!

00:20:58.920 --> 00:20:59.560
Geez!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:02.280
Hmph.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.020
That's fine.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:05.720
I don’t care if I was tricked!

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:08.570
I don't want to be the kind of 
person who's always paranoid!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.530
Why you...

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:17.680
Hey you!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:18.640
Are you listening to me?!

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.430
Calm down... calm down...

00:21:19.430 --> 00:21:20.130
Shove it!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:20.650
Hey!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:21.370
You little brat!

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:07.060
I can't take it!

00:23:07.060 --> 00:23:08.540
What's with that girl?!

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:10.440
What are you all excited about, Meroko?

00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:12.040
Do you remember Wakamatsu Madoka?

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:13.920
She's the one from the Seed Record New Artist audition.

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:15.810
...who lost to Mitsuki, but...

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:18.700
...to have her as a rival now... I just can't stand it!

00:23:18.700 --> 00:23:19.540
Hey, hey.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:21.220
You're going with her today, right?

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:22.080
Will you be all right?

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:22.650
Ah!

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:23.870
Just leave it to me.

00:23:23.870 --> 00:23:26.490
This Meroko-sama here is going to 
support her perfectly! {edited}

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:29.080
That's what I'm most worried about.

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.360
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:32.840
A Rival Appears!
